    <markdownProperty name="text" category="detail"><![CDATA[Library users must be able to **renew their active loans** from the BiblioUS web portal at any time, without going to a circulation desk. A renewal extends the due date by the loan period for the user's type (see *Appendix: Current loan policy*), counting from the renewal date.

The system must **reject** a renewal when:

- the user has used up the renewals allowed for their type,
- the item has at least one active **hold**, or
- the loan is already overdue.

If a renewal is rejected, the portal must tell the user why. Three days before any due date, the system must send an **e-mail reminder**.]]></markdownProperty>
